Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 04:24:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(accounts): allow marking a primary account

Add an is_primary flag so one account sorts first in lists and is
pre-selected in expense/income forms. Setting primary clears any other;
archiving a primary account drops the flag.
